WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.680
Did you know that if you mix ripe bananas

00:02.680 --> 00:04.560
and a sweet potato in a bowl,

00:04.560 --> 00:07.320
then add peanut butter, two eggs, baking powder,

00:07.320 --> 00:09.960
a handful of walnuts, and some dark chocolate

00:09.960 --> 00:11.400
to give it that rich flavor.

00:11.400 --> 00:14.000
Mix everything together, pour it into a loaf pan,

00:14.000 --> 00:14.880
just like this.

00:14.880 --> 00:19.520
Add a few extra walnuts, then bake it for around 55 minutes.

00:19.520 --> 00:23.260
You end up with a soft, rich, sweet potato banana bread

00:23.260 --> 00:24.600
that's actually good for your gut.

00:24.600 --> 00:26.960
And because all the sweetness comes from the bananas

00:26.960 --> 00:29.000
and the sweet potato, there's no refined sugar

00:29.000 --> 00:30.160
and no crash afterwards.

00:30.160 --> 00:32.880
If you enjoyed this recipe, comment what state you're from

00:32.880 --> 00:34.800
so I know you watched all the way through.

00:34.800 --> 00:37.800
And don't forget to follow me for more content like this.

